{
  "summary": "Section F supplies additional reporting instructions for cancellation, nonrenewal, and declination notice reason codes under the 2026 TICO Texas Statistical Plan for Residential Risks. It clarifies when to use selected reason categories, requires source indication when third-party or aerial imagery information is relied on, and maps Section C policy-form/construction/line-of-business values to Section E type-of-policy codes for reason-code reporting.",
